 "summary": "High-performance language and system based on rewriting logic and membership equational logic, descended from OBJ3: functional modules define equational theories, system modules add (possibly concurrent) rewrite rules, and reflection supports metaprogramming; used for executable semantics, model checking (LTL, search) and narrowing.",
 "status": "active",
 "defined_by": [
  "reference-implementation",
  "academic-paper"
 ],
